+# ROOT-SECURITY-RELEASE
+
+## CVE-2026-86047 ? False positive on MariaDB 10.11.19 (Debian bookworm)
+
+### Overview
+
+CVE-2026-86047 is an SQL injection in SHOW CREATE SERVER, SHOW CREATE USER,
+and mariadb-dump. Identifiers and values were not quoted consistently when
+serialized to SQL (MDEV-39818, MDEV-39776, MDEV-40308, MDEV-40311).
+
+### Why bookworm 1:10.11.19-0+deb12u1 does not need this patch
+
+Upstream fixed this in 10.11.19. The `mariadb-10.11.19` tag already contains:
+
+- `innobase_quote_identifier()` doubles embedded quote characters
+  (`storage/innobase/handler/ha_innodb.cc`).
+- `append_unescaped()` takes `in_comment` and escapes a `*/` sequence
+  (`sql/table.cc`, `sql/table.h`).
+- `print_grant()` quotes user and host with `append_identifier()`
+  (`sql/sql_acl.cc`).
+- mariadb-dump quotes trigger, plugin, and replication identifiers
+  (`client/mysqldump.c`).
+- unknown table-option names are rejected unless they are valid identifiers
+  (`sql/create_options.cc`).
+- SHOW CREATE quotes option values with `append_unescaped()`
+  (`sql/sql_show.cc`).
+
+Re-applying the 10.11.18 backport fails. Every hunk in `client/mysqldump.c`
+and the mysql-test result files misses, because that pre-fix context is gone.
+
+The Debian tracker still marks bookworm-security as vulnerable. That status
+has not caught up with the 10.11.19 source. MariaDB lists CVE-2026-86047 as
+fixed in 10.11.19.
+
+### Verdict
+
+**No code patch required.** Treat scanner findings of CVE-2026-86047 on
+`mariadb` `1:10.11.19-0+deb12u1` as a **false positive**.
+
+This file is documentation only. It does not change MariaDB behavior.
+
+### References
+
+- https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-86047
+- https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-39818
+- https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/5acb43522863c9bd6b91f354104ea247bf513e9a
+- https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/d5d741a3076f911b468518d6b06a917593498c5b
+- https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/3646569225758c8225e7342783d775ef7c7570e5
+- https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/2b28d1c424104429eeed43115ee6d8a803671d52
+- https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/9d4ffe23b25808f7858b2dc48106fbd60cf0e513
